# Anything below NEVER goes into a docker build context.
#
# Critical: secrets + git history must not leak into images.
# Performance: keeping node_modules + .git out cuts the context size from
# ~1GB+ to <50MB, dramatically speeding up `docker build` upload + cache.

# ── Secrets ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.local
.env.*
!.env.example
installs/*.local
!installs/example.local
**/.gcloud
**/.kube

# ── Git ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes

# ── Node ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.astro
**/coverage
**/.cache
**/.parcel-cache
*.log
.DS_Store

# ── Local dev tooling ──────────────────────────────────────────────
.devspace
.local
examples/

# ── Editor / OS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode
.idea
*.swp
*.bak

# ── Runtime artifacts ──────────────────────────────────────────────
**/build
test-results/
playwright-report/
**/__pycache__

# ── Documentation site build outputs ───────────────────────────────
docs/dist
docs/.astro

# ── Project-specific never-ship files ──────────────────────────────
MEMORY.md
ROADMAP.md
test-site.mjs
.claude/
.wrangler/
